# Pumpcrown Works (CIPlay pumpcrown_works): the purifier hall's door refusing a stranger, the guards' laundry (the
# coat), the door, the hall's locker, the tank house, the pipe gallery, the purifier bench, the stores, the outfall
# (the plan's lowstreet rule); then the contract: the roster, the boom tower, its winch, three screechers, the receipt.
# offset 0 0 is a placeholder: phase 2 sets it from the recipe's save log (PLAY_FORMAT: Coordinates).
island Pumpcrown Works
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Authority's Water
use hallgate
expect shown hallgate
open Laundry basket
wait 3
expect story authcoat 1
expect step 1
use hallgate
expect hidden hallgate
open Purifier hall
wait 3
expect step 2
read Dobbs's complaints
expect step 3
read Councillor's memo
expect step 4
# STORY 10-24: the climb for Dobbs's stick, the tape, the breaker, the dive to the reversed gauge
zone pc_trail
expect step 5
openat -40.2 -18.9
zone pc_summit
expect step 6
expect stand -37.9 -8.93 h=38
open Old water tower deck box
wait 3
expect story pc_top 1
# expect step 7 (story:tape is counted early, before its step comes: Fleetbreak and Hookline give tape rolls in the plan)
open Linesman's locker
wait 3
expect story tape 3
expect step 8
read Dobbs's warning
expect step 9
expect shown pc_shock
use pc_breaker
expect hidden pc_shock
expect story pc_breaker 1
expect step 10
zone pc_deep
expect step 11
expect stand -63 -44 h=-16
open Flooded intake chamber strongbox
wait 3
expect story pc_deep 1
expect step 12
open Tank house locker
wait 3
expect step 13
open Pipe gallery
wait 3
expect step 14
open Purifier bench
wait 3
expect step 15
open Authority stores
wait 3
expect step 16
zone reservoir_bank
expect step 17
read Filter house notice
expect step 18
open Patrol van's lockbox
wait 3
expect step 19
zone sludge_beds
expect step 20
read Complaint No. 300
expect step 21
zone outfall
expect done
expect step 0 quest=2
expect title Keep the Boom quest=2
read Authority duty roster
expect step 1 quest=2
zone boom_tower
expect step 2 quest=2
use boomwinch
expect story boomwinch 1
expect step 3 quest=2
kill Screecher
expect animals Screecher 0
expect step 4 quest=2
read Authority receipt
expect done quest=2
